/Title (On the day of your hearing, your lawyer reassures you about their continued support and guidance even if the case appears to be proceeding slowly and/or not in the most favourable direction. Everything manages to begin on time, and the judge attentively listens to the arguments. By the end, the judge announces that bail will be granted on the date of the next hearing.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
