/Title (When the date of the next hearing arrives, the bail is granted at once. Your family rejoices and your lawyer congratulates you for the same. When you step into the jail again, you know it is for the last time. Your friends ask you to treat them for the good news by buying them some chocolates and cookies from the canteen. They ask you to recount the proceedings of the hearing, and you are all too happy to do a dramatic re-enactment.)
